:: MP NPC Monet More2 Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
阁楼天窗擦亮后，午后的斜光比前些日子更利落。<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>把攒下的五张试色卡排在木地板上：杏灰、霉绿、旧铜归在画室前案，锡白与雾青压在窗台后匣，城南旧剧场、退潮礁石与秋日海雾画展则用炭笔夹在写生册里。她拍了拍膝头的粉笔灰，让你挑一处先定下画框的边。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回画室 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<windowicon>><<link [[看画室前案活 (0:03)|MP NPC Monet Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[先翻窗台试色匣 (0:03)|MP NPC Monet Daily More2 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mppainticon>><<link [[查远光写生与画展 (0:03)|MP NPC Monet Date More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Daily More Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
画室前案上摆着三桩打底工序。斜顶最高处的天窗<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyMonet10>>已经用醋水擦得透亮，进屋的光冷得正好<<else>>积了一层暖灰，害得她调出的颜色总偏黄半度<</if>>；委托退回的旧画框<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyMonet11>>缺角已经补平旧金<<else>>磕掉了一角金箔，急需用冷暖双色金接住<</if>>；酒精灯上的小铜锅<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyMonet12>>已经熬好兔皮胶并刷完了新画布<<else>>泡着一夜兔皮胶，正等看火熬到能拉出细丝<</if>>。<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>把梯子扶稳，等你挑一件动手。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回总目 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<windowicon>><<link [[上梯擦亮天窗 (0:08)|MP NPC Monet Daily 10]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><br>
<<mptailoricon>><<link [[修补画框旧金角 (0:10)|MP NPC Monet Daily 11]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[看火熬制兔皮底胶 (0:08)|MP NPC Monet Daily 12]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Daily More2 Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
窗台后匣里收着两件辨色细活。街角小贩留下的那包便宜群青<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyMonet13>>已经用白醋与火苗验出底细<<else>>颜色蓝里发灰，得拿醋与酒精灯试出真假<</if>>；上了底的小木板上<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyMonet14>>已经排好八格雾天灰阶<<else>>还空着半排方格，等着趁河雾漫窗时排定灰阶<</if>>。<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>把刮刀递到你手边，说这两样活靠的是眼力与耐性。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回试色总目 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[检验可疑群青 (0:08)|MP NPC Monet Daily 13]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><br>
<<mpmapicon>><<link [[趁雾天排定灰阶卡 (0:08)|MP NPC Monet Daily 14]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Date More Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
<<set _monetYearNow to (Time.date.year or 0)>>
写生册里记着两处不肯等人的远光与秋日海雾画展。城南废弃剧场的破穹顶下<<if $daily.mpNpcDateMonet5>>今日已经追过那束斜光<<else>>午后三点会落下一根斜插池座的光柱，只停一刻钟<</if>>；海边退潮后的湿礁石<<if $daily.mpNpcDateMonet6>>今日已经画过那抹铜绿<<else>>会在最后一线夕光里由锡白翻成铜绿<</if>>。至于一年一度的海雾画展，<<if (_npc.festivalYear or 0) is _monetYearNow>>今年的展期已经落幕<<elseif Time.season is "autumn">>眼下正是绷布调雾青的筹备期<<else>>要等秋雾拢街时才会布展<</if>>。

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回总目 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[先去剧场写生 (0:12)|MP NPC Monet Date 5]]>><<pass 12>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[前往海边礁石滩 (0:12)|MP NPC Monet Date 6]]>><<pass 12>><</link>><br>
<<if (_npc.hasMet or 0) and Time.season is "autumn" and (_npc.festivalYear or 0) isnot _monetYearNow>>
<<mplampicon>><<link [[翻看海雾画展专页 (0:04)|MP NPC Monet Festival Prep]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<elseif (_npc.festivalYear or 0) is _monetYearNow>>
今年画展已经落幕，展架收回阁楼墙角。
<<elseif not (_npc.hasMet or 0)>>
画展的筹备册还压在画箱底下。
<<else>>
海雾画展要等秋雾拢街时才会布展。
<</if>>
:: MP NPC Monet Daily 10 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
上午的天光落在画架上，比平时偏黄半度。<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>仰头敲了敲斜顶最高处的天窗，说玻璃积了一层暖灰，得先用滴了白醋的温水湿擦除垢，再用干棉布收净水痕。<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyMonet10>>天窗已经擦得澄澈透亮，屋里的冷暖分界线清清楚楚。<<else>>她在梯脚垫好硬纸板，把拧到半干的热棉布递给你。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回前案活计 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[踩木梯擦天窗 (0:08)|MP NPC Monet Daily 10 After]]>><<pass 8>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActMonet10 to 1>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 230 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 230>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkMonet10 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkMonet10 to 0>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[在梯下扶稳递干布 (0:08)|MP NPC Monet Daily 10 After]]>><<pass 8>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActMonet10 to 2>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 210>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkMonet10 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkMonet10 to 0>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Daily 11 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
委托人送回的雕花木框在右上角磕掉了一块旧金。<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>把画框平放在工作台上，说补金不能只贴新箔，得先拿细砂纸把石膏底刮平，再把偏冷与偏暖的两种碎金箔在缺口边沿一笔笔压匀接住。<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyMonet11>>画框缺角已经补得严丝合缝，对着窗光也看不出半点接痕。<<else>>金箔薄如蝉翼，连呼吸都得放轻。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回前案活计 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[打磨石膏底边 (0:10)|MP NPC Monet Daily 11 After]]>><<pass 10>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActMonet11 to 1>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkMonet11 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkMonet11 to 0>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mptailoricon>><<link [[屏息贴合冷暖金箔 (0:10)|MP NPC Monet Daily 11 After]]>><<pass 10>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActMonet11 to 2>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 220 or ($willpower or 0) gte 220>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkMonet11 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkMonet11 to 0>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Daily 12 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
新绷好的亚麻画布靠在墙角，酒精灯上的小铜锅里温着泡了一夜的兔皮胶。<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>握着木勺轻轻搅动，说熬胶最忌火急：火大了胶性变脆，画布一折就裂；必须小火慢撇浮沫，熬到木勺提起能连成琥珀细线才算刚好。<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyMonet12>>上好底胶的画布已经绷得像一面小鼓，静静立在阴凉处收干。<<else>>锅面正浮起第一层细沫。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回前案活计 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[守着铜锅撇沫 (0:08)|MP NPC Monet Daily 12 After]]>><<pass 8>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActMonet12 to 1>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkMonet12 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkMonet12 to 0>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[顺着纹理刮平底胶 (0:10)|MP NPC Monet Daily 12 After]]>><<pass 10>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActMonet12 to 2>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 210 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 230>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkMonet12 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkMonet12 to 0>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Daily 13 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
窗台上摊着街角小贩留下的那包廉价群青，粉末在侧光下透出可疑的铅灰。<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>取来瓷碟、白醋与铁匙，说真青金石磨出的粉蓝里带紫，滴醋不冒泡、过火不发黑；掺了白垩与铜蓝的假货一试便知。<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyMonet13>>搀假的色粉已经挑出来封存，只留下半碟能垫底的灰蓝。<<else>>她用竹刮刀挑出两小撮色粉，分在两只碟里。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回窗台试色 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet Daily More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[滴入白醋验色 (0:08)|MP NPC Monet Daily 13 After]]>><<pass 8>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActMonet13 to 1>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 210 or ($willpower or 0) gte 220>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkMonet13 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkMonet13 to 0>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[架在灯焰上烧色粉 (0:10)|MP NPC Monet Daily 13 After]]>><<pass 10>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActMonet13 to 2>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 240>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkMonet13 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkMonet13 to 0>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Daily 14 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
河雾贴着窗玻璃往上漫，街对面屋檐的颜色全被收进一片潮润的灰白里。<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>把上了底的小木板横在窗台上，上面画着八个小方格，分别调了青灰、紫灰与锡白。她要把这八种灰排进同一口气里，留作雾天写生的基准色卡。<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyMonet14>>八格雾色卡已经标好次序收进木盒，色阶过渡得像一层真雾。<<else>>她让你帮着举板对光。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回窗台试色 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet Daily More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpmapicon>><<link [[按冷暖排色卡 (0:08)|MP NPC Monet Daily 14 After]]>><<pass 8>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActMonet14 to 1>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 220 or ($english or 0) gte 210>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkMonet14 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkMonet14 to 0>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[举起色板对窗比色 (0:10)|MP NPC Monet Daily 14 After]]>><<pass 10>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActMonet14 to 2>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 210 or ($tending or 0) gte 220>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkMonet14 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkMonet14 to 0>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Date 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
城南废弃剧场的木门虚掩着，穹顶破口在午后三点准时漏下一束斜光，正好切在池座第七排偏左的位置。<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>提着画箱站在门廊阴影里，说那束光只在破舞台上停一刻钟，浮尘在光柱里翻滚得像极细的金粉。<<if $daily.mpNpcDateMonet5>>今日那束斜光已经画进速写册，剧场里只剩凉沁沁的阴影。<<else>>必须趁光柱未移先支好画架。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回写生目录 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[随她进场支架 (0:12)|MP NPC Monet Date 5 Choice]]>><<pass 12>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[先在门廊观察倾角 (0:14)|MP NPC Monet Date 5 Choice]]>><<pass 14>><<stress -1>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Date 5 Choice [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
旧剧场池座里比街面凉得多，<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>把画板支在第七排木椅间，飞快地铺开锡白与赭石底色。破穹顶灌下的穿堂风吹得画纸边缘瑟瑟发抖，暗部浮雕又藏在背光里，她头也不抬地问你能帮她稳住哪一头。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回门廊 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet Date 5]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[按稳晃动顶板 (0:12)|MP NPC Monet Date 5 After]]>><<set $daily.mpNpcDateMonet5 to 1>><<tiredness 1>><<pass 12>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[举小铜镜补暗部 (0:12)|MP NPC Monet Date 5 After]]>><<set $daily.mpNpcDateMonet5 to 2>><<stress 1>><<pass 12>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[替她描摹舞台壁饰 (0:16)|MP NPC Monet Date 5 After]]>><<set $daily.mpNpcDateMonet5 to 3>><<tiredness 1>><<pass 16>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Date 5 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
<<set _pick to ($daily.mpNpcDateMonet5 or 1)>>
<<set _ok to (($athletics or 0) gte 230 or ($willpower or 0) gte 240 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 12)>>
<<set _first to !$daily.mpNpcDateMonet5Done>>
<<set $daily.mpNpcDateMonet5Done to 1>>
穹顶的光柱一点点爬上舞台后墙，<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>赶在光影消散前落下了最亮的一笔锡白。<<if _ok>>画布上的斜光仿佛还带着浮尘的温度，她收笔时指尖在你手背轻轻一点，说这幅画的四条边有你撑着才没散。<<if _first>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>><<stress -5>><</if>><<else>>穿堂风还是让最后一笔晃了半寸，她用刮刀收平边角，说留着这道折痕也算剧场原本的脾气。<<if _first>><<stress 2>><</if>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回写生目录 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[提着画箱回阁楼 (0:04)|MP NPC Monet More2 Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Date 6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "searocks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
退潮后的海边礁石湿漉漉地露在水面，水洼平得像一块打磨过的旧锡。<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>把画箱用麻绳系在腰间，站在高处盯着云缝：夕光落海前那一刻，湿石头会先亮成锡白，再猛地翻出一层铜绿。<<if $daily.mpNpcDateMonet6>>今日那抹转瞬即逝的铜绿已经收进画板，晚潮正重新漫上礁盘。<<else>>离变色只剩十来分钟，得趁潮未涨下礁。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回写生目录 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[趁退潮下礁石 (0:12)|MP NPC Monet Date 6 Choice]]>><<pass 12>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[先在高处看清云脚 (0:14)|MP NPC Monet Date 6 Choice]]>><<pass 14>><<stress -1>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Date 6 Choice [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "searocks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
海风带着咸涩的水汽贴着礁盘横扫过来，<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>把画板卡在两块黑礁石的豁口间。远处的云脚已经裂开一道金缝，浪花拍在石根上溅起细沫，她拧开松节油瓶，让你帮着护住画板与调色盘。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回高坡 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet Date 6]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[背画箱压礁石 (0:14)|MP NPC Monet Date 6 After]]>><<set $daily.mpNpcDateMonet6 to 1>><<tiredness 1>><<pass 14>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[张开外套挡海风 (0:12)|MP NPC Monet Date 6 After]]>><<set $daily.mpNpcDateMonet6 to 2>><<stress 1>><<pass 12>><</link>><br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[先在木片试调铜绿 (0:14)|MP NPC Monet Date 6 After]]>><<set $daily.mpNpcDateMonet6 to 3>><<tiredness 1>><<pass 14>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Date 6 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "searocks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
<<set _pick to ($daily.mpNpcDateMonet6 or 1)>>
<<set _ok to (($athletics or 0) gte 230 or ($willpower or 0) gte 240 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 14)>>
<<set _first to !$daily.mpNpcDateMonet6Done>>
<<set $daily.mpNpcDateMonet6Done to 1>>
夕光擦过海面的刹那，整块湿礁果然由冷白翻作幽深的铜绿。<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>连落三刀把那一线寒光钉在画布中央。<<if _ok>>涨潮的第一波浪漫上脚背前，你们稳稳退回岸坡，她看着未干的色块难得地笑出声来。<<if _first>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>><<stress -5>><</if>><<else>>浪沫溅湿了画纸下沿，她顺势用拇指抹开水痕，说大海自己添了一笔灰边。<<if _first>><<stress 2>><</if>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回写生目录 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[踏着潮声送她回 (0:04)|MP NPC Monet More2 Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Festival Prep [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
秋雾漫进高街前七天，<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>把阁楼腾出一半位置筹备海雾画展。参展的主画还差一碗调匀的雾青，亚麻布边与三副木展架也得提前加固。<<if (_npc.axis or 0) gte 35>>她把主画的底色托付给你，说只有你懂她要的那层冷光。<<else>>她分出三件展前杂务，让你挑一件顺手的帮她备齐。<</if>>

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回目录 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[去备节前物料 (0:10)|MP NPC Monet Festival]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpNpcs.monet.festivalPrep to "ready">><<set $mpNpcs.monet.festivalPrepYear to (Time.date.year or 0)>><<stress -2>><</link>>
:: MP NPC Monet Festival [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
海雾画展开幕当天，整条康努达图斯街都笼在乳白秋雾里。<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>的展位设在拱廊尽头的斜光下，三幅小画已经挂稳，唯独正中那幅海雾主画还留着一角未干的边。看展的人流渐密，她把刮刀拿在手里，问你此刻怎么配合。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回目录 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[守在展位看画 (0:12)|MP NPC Monet Festival Resolve]]>><<pass 12>><<set $daily.mpNpcMonetFestPick to 1>><<tiredness 2>><<stress -1>><</link>><br>
<<mppainticon>><<link [[替她扶框补末笔 (0:12)|MP NPC Monet Festival Resolve]]>><<pass 12>><<set $daily.mpNpcMonetFestPick to 2>><<stress 1>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[去拱廊口引导路人 (0:10)|MP NPC Monet Festival Resolve]]>><<pass 10>><<set $daily.mpNpcMonetFestPick to 3>><<tiredness 1>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Festival Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
<<set _year to (Time.date.year or 0)>>
<<set _first to ((_npc.festivalYear or 0) isnot _year)>>
<<set _pick to ($daily.mpNpcMonetFestPick or 1)>>
<<set _prepOk to ((_npc.festivalPrepYear or 0) is _year and (_npc.festivalPrep or "none") is "ready")>>
<<set _axEff to ((_npc.axis or 0) + (_prepOk ? 8 : 0))>>
<<set _ok to (($tending or 0) gte 220 or ($english or 0) gte 220 or _axEff gte 30)>>
<<set _mid to (_pick is 1 or _axEff gte 15)>>
<<set _res to (_ok ? "success" : (_mid ? "partial" : "fail"))>>
拱廊外的秋雾与画布上的雾青渐渐融为一色。<<if _ok>>最后一笔冷白稳稳接住了雾气，驻足看画的人一直排到台阶下，<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>当晚便把这幅得意之作收进了里间馆藏。<<set _npc.festivalResult to "success">><<if _first>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 6)>><<set _npc.artworks to Math.min(3, (_npc.artworks or 0) + 1)>><<stress -4>><<set _npc.festivalYear to _year>><</if>><<elseif _mid>>最后一笔收得略急，她把画留在展架上透气，说明年雾起时再补半寸冷光。<<set _npc.festivalResult to "partial">><<if _first>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 2)>><<stress -1>><<set _npc.festivalYear to _year>><</if>><<else>>湿气洇开了未干的底色，那幅画没能挂上主展位，也没能拿到半分画酬。<<set _npc.festivalResult to "fail">><<if _first>><<set _npc.axis to Math.max(0, (_npc.axis or 0) - 4)>><<stress 3>><<set _npc.festivalYear to _year>><</if>><</if>>
天窗外的浮云缓缓游过屋脊，画架旁的松节油罐散着清冽的微香。<br><br>
<<getouticon>>
<<if _res is "fail">>
<<link [[收拢未干画布 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet Festival Missed]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mplampicon>><<link [[独自收拾干裂雾青 (0:04)|MP NPC Monet Festival Missed]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<link [[看画展余波 (0:04)|MP NPC Monet Festival After]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<mppainticon>><<link [[陪她收画回阁楼 (0:04)|MP NPC Monet Date More Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Monet Festival After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
画展散场后的阁楼还留着松节油与秋雾的凉气。<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>把展架折好靠回墙根，端着两杯温茶走到天窗下。<<if _npc.festivalResult is "success">>她指着挂上第四枚铜钉的新画，说这一季的光没有白等，画框背面的落款特意留了你的名字缩写。<<elseif _npc.festivalResult is "partial">>她用亚麻布蒙住半干的画作，语气平静地说明年秋雾再来时一定把那半寸光补齐。<<elseif _npc.festivalResult is "missed">>她把今年没挂出的画一张张卷好，塞进画箱夹层，说明年雾起前先把雾青调足，不再让颜色在碟里干裂。<<else>>她把洇开的画布翻过来扣在木架上，说明年重调一碗更耐潮的底胶。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回写生目录 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[同她坐看天窗暮色 (0:06)|MP NPC Monet More2 Hub]]>><<pass 6>><<stress -2>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Festival Missed [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
<<set _npc.festivalResult to "missed">>
海雾画展那天人潮来得急。等秋雾散尽再去阁楼时，靠墙的木展架空着，那碗调好的雾青已经在瓷碟里干裂成碎片。<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>正把没挂出去的画布慢慢卷起，见你进门只是淡淡一笑，说雾天一季只有一回，错过的光只能留待明年再捉。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回写生目录 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mppainticon>><<link [[应下明年来布展 (0:06)|MP NPC Monet Festival After]]>><<pass 6>><<stress -1>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Daily 10 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
<<set _act to ($daily.mpNpcDailyActMonet10 or 1)>>
<<set _ok to ($daily.mpNpcDailyOkMonet10 or 0)>>
阁楼斜顶那扇天窗终于透亮，斜光落到地板上，切出一块边缘利落的亮方。莫奈退到画架前眯眼比了比色，冷暖过渡比先前准了半度。<<if _act is 1 and _ok>>你踩稳木梯擦净最后一圈水痕，她把试色卡贴上窗棂，说这层冷光正好压住底稿的暖灰。<<elseif _act is 1>>梯脚轻轻一晃，棉布角在玻璃上拖出一道雾痕，她摆手说不碍事，把速写改到午后。<<elseif _ok>>你在梯下稳稳托住横档，干布递得恰到好处，她探身把窗角最后一星灰也收干。<<else>>你递布慢了半拍，她探身去够窗角时险些踩空，只好先下梯歇口气。<</if>>
<<if !$daily.mpNpcDailyMonet10>>
<<set $daily.mpNpcDailyMonet10 to 1>>
<<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
<<if _ok>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><<tiredness 1>><</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回日常页 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去下一件事 (0:03)|MP NPC Monet Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Daily 11 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
